  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d756df6f220961c3cc63425cb0d5f6b5e6bcc49.png\" alt=\"Ascended Quark 標誌\" width=\"593\" height=\"212\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/xB6gaUv66t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1045640095853707345?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Discord\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>✔️&nbsp; 這是什麼？&nbsp; ✔️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Ascended Quark</strong> 是一款模組擴充，旨在為 Vazkii 的 Quark 和 Aether 團隊的 Aether Mod 之間添加相容性。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">許多功能包括天根木變種方塊、安布羅西烏姆燈、聖石爐等等。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組將持續更新，添加其他功能，最重要的是，我們希望製作一些原創內容，以保持 Quark 在原版遊戲中的風格。<br><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❗&nbsp; 需求&nbsp; ❗</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您當然需要：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><br><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🔗&nbsp; <strong>連結&nbsp; </strong>🔗<br><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971104/description_215f305b-aa0f-4721-9138-41bc567a935f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"495\" height=\"230\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/xB6gaUv66t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1045640095853707345?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Discord\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"></a><br></span></p><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:22px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:22px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
